---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 90
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    Build[Immutable release build]
    Lease[Exclusive canonical host lease]
    Noise[Same-build calibration-v1 comparison]
    NoiseOracle[Exact workload oracles]
    NoiseEvidence[Noise bounds, power, orientation effect, block counts]
    Capacity[Single-build capacity-v1 staircase]
    CapacityOracle[Exact terminal and service-pressure checks]
    CapacityEvidence[One/two-worker CPU or latency knees, or lower bounds]
    Review[Reviewed practical budgets]
    Publish[Immutable reference-v2 baseline]
    Compare[Fixed-load baseline/candidate comparison]
    Gate{Confidence interval versus budget}
    Pass[Pass or improvement]
    Confirm[Independent fixed confirmation run]
    Regression[Confirmed regression]
    Invalid[Invalid or inconclusive]

    Build --> Lease
    Lease --> Noise --> NoiseOracle --> NoiseEvidence
    Lease --> Capacity --> CapacityOracle --> CapacityEvidence
    NoiseEvidence --> Review
    CapacityEvidence --> Publish
    Review --> Publish
    Publish --> Compare --> Gate
    Gate -->|within budget| Pass
    Gate -->|first over-budget signal| Confirm --> Gate
    Gate -->|confirmed over budget| Regression
    Gate -->|noise, saturation, or missing evidence| Invalid

    class Build,Lease component
    class Noise,Capacity,Compare system
    class NoiseOracle,CapacityOracle,Gate decision
    class NoiseEvidence,CapacityEvidence,Review,Publish external
    class Pass success
    class Regression failure
    class Invalid warning
